     1929   run disgdsru-name in this-procedure ( input p-templ-rl-root
     1930                                        ,output v-rule-label) no-error.
     1931   return v-rule-label.
     1932   end function.
     1933   function disgdsru-get-disc-role-label returns character ( input p-discnt-role as character):
