    11608               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "IDCMode" , input string(3), input 1 ).
    11609               run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "IDCPrice", input string(cash-dis-rule.discnt-value),  input 1 ).
    11610             end.
