    11635       run bgelib-tag-open in this-procedure ( input 3, input "ItemDisCat", input "" ).
    11636       run bgelib-tag-close in this-procedure ( input 3, input "ItemDisCat").
    11637     end.
    11638   if pos-type <> 'InfoKiosk':U then do:
    11639         if tax-cass
    11640         AND vaction = "U" then do:
