    13728       input stream bar from value(v-kat-file) convert source "ibm866" .
    13729       output stream plucash to value(v-temp-kat-file) convert target "ibm866".
    13730       _rr:
    13731       repeat:
    13732         import stream bar unformatted ss.
    13733         if not ss begins fill(chr(32), 2 )
    13734         or can-find(first cash-ncr-save-param no-lock where
