    13896       run maria-put in this-procedure (
    13897                                       buffer for-cash-desk
    13898                                     , input out
    13899                                     , input fname
    13900                                     , input yes
    13901                                     , input v-fields-shift117
    13902                                     , input yes
    13903                                     , input 24
    13904                                     , input 1
